# SmartAttend Hub - Implementation Plan

## Project Overview

SmartAttend Hub is an attendance management system with role-based hierarchy:
- **HOD** → Super admin for department (manages faculty & students)
- **Faculty** → Admin for assigned classes (marks attendance, approves requests)
- **Student** → User (views attendance, submits requests)

