## 📋 Remaining Implementation Plan

### Phase 2B: Backend Completion

#### [MODIFY] main.py
Register all new routers and add middleware:
```python
# Add all routers
app.include_router(auth_router, prefix="/api/auth", tags=["Authentication"])
app.include_router(hod_router, prefix="/api/hod", tags=["HOD Management"])
app.include_router(faculty_router, prefix="/api/faculty", tags=["Faculty"])
app.include_router(student_router, prefix="/api/student", tags=["Student"])
app.include_router(attendance_router, prefix="/api/attendance", tags=["Attendance"])
app.include_router(analytics_router, prefix="/api/analytics", tags=["Analytics"])
```

#### [NEW] services/notification_service.py
- SMS webhook integration (n8n/Twilio)
- Email notifications
- Push notification queueing
- Notification preferences

#### [NEW] services/analytics_service.py
- Department-wide statistics
- Class attendance trends
- Student risk analysis
- Report generation (PDF/Excel)

#### [NEW] api/attendance.py (Dedicated Routes)
- Start/complete session endpoints
- Bulk attendance marking
- Unique ID verification
- Real-time status updates

#### [NEW] api/analytics.py
- Department analytics (HOD)
- Class analytics (Faculty)
- Student analytics (all roles)
- Export endpoints (PDF/Excel/CSV)

