### Phase 3: AI Integration

#### [NEW] services/ml_service.py
```python
class AttendancePredictor:
    """Predict student attendance probability"""
    - Historical pattern analysis
    - Day/time correlation
    - Subject-specific trends
    
class AnomalyDetector:
    """Detect unusual attendance patterns"""
    - Sudden attendance drops
    - Proxy attendance detection
    - Location mismatch alerts
    
class RiskAnalyzer:
    """Identify at-risk students"""
    - Below 75% attendance alerts
    - Declining trend detection
    - Parent notification triggers
```

#### [NEW] api/ai.py
- `/api/ai/predict/{student_id}` - Get attendance prediction
- `/api/ai/anomalies` - List detected anomalies
- `/api/ai/risk-students` - Get at-risk students

---

### Phase 4: Real-time Features

#### [MODIFY] Frontend Supabase Integration
Add real-time subscriptions in React:

```typescript
// attendanceService.ts
subscribeToAttendanceUpdates(sessionId: string, callback)
subscribeToNotifications(userId: string, callback)
subscribeToAnnouncements(classId: string, callback)
```

#### [NEW] WebSocket Endpoints (Optional)
If Supabase real-time is insufficient:
- `/ws/attendance/{session_id}` - Live attendance updates
- `/ws/notifications/{user_id}` - Real-time notifications

