### Phase 7: Testing & Verification

#### Database Testing
1. Run [database_schema_enhanced.sql](file:///c:/Users/samit/Downloads/attendance/attendance/backend/database_schema_enhanced.sql) in Supabase SQL Editor
2. Verify all tables created
3. Test RLS policies with different roles
4. Verify triggers execute correctly

#### API Testing
1. Test auth endpoints (login, refresh, logout)
2. Test HOD endpoints (CRUD operations)
3. Test Faculty endpoints (attendance marking)
4. Test Student endpoints (viewing, requests)
5. Verify role-based access restrictions

#### Frontend Testing
1. Login flow for all roles
2. Dashboard data loading
3. Real-time updates working
4. Form submissions
5. Export functionality

